TableCraft contains local customization and analysis tools for a separately
installed or locally embedded copy of TablePlus. It is not the source code of TablePlus.

The repository's MIT license covers its original code and documentation. It
does not license the TablePlus application, its executable code, frameworks,
compiled interface resources, vendor artwork, or user connection profiles.
The customized vendor runtime is included in runtime-seed/ as archive parts.
User connection profiles and TablePlus source code are not included.

TablePlus is a product of TablePlus Inc. Existing vendor author and copyright
credits in locally customized copies are retained.

PDFCraft and the Craft app collection were supplied as presentation and visual
references. No ArtCraft logo, community affiliation, or third-party reference
collage is included in the public assets. TableCraft is independently maintained.

The elephant illustration was generated with OpenAI ImageGen for this project.
See docs/branding.md for provenance and the included asset list.

A locally generated runtime/ directory and portable ZIP may contain the complete
customized vendor application. These local artifacts retain the vendor license
and are reconstructed from the runtime-seed/ parts included in this repository.
